  "description": "Sama is a soft and elegant fragrance that blends juicy fruits with delicate florals and a smooth musky base. The scent feels feminine, airy, and modern while maintaining a gentle sweetness that makes it easy to wear daily. The opening introduces fruity accords with citrus nuances, creating a bright and uplifting first impression that feels clean and inviting. The heart develops into jasmine, rose, and soft white florals, adding a graceful floral elegance with a smooth feminine touch. The base settles into musk, vanilla, and woods, leaving a warm, clean, and long-lasting trail that feels soft, creamy, and comforting. Sama is perfect for women who enjoy fruity floral fragrances with a clean musky dry-down and an elegant everyday character.",
